  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築產業經營與策略",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL INDUSTRY MANAGEMENT STRATEGY",
    "describe_ch": "由於建築開發相關上下游產業甚廣，常被比喻為火車頭產業，為期建築開發產業營運之精進與多元發展，本課程旨在闡述建築開發關聯產業之經營與策略，依其生產過程鏈結之相關領域產業別之經營與策略進行研析。",
    "describe_eh": "Due to the construction development has a wide range of upstream and downstream related industries, it is often referred to as a locomotive industry. With the operational excellence and multi-development of construction development industry, this course aims to explain the operation and strategy of the building development related industries. Analyze the operation and strategy of the industry in the relevant field based on the link of its production process.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
